<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Mona Eraiba said she raised her 1996 earnings per share view on Intel Corp to $4.70 from $4.55 and her 1997 EPS view to $5.80 from $5.30.</p>
<p>-- She said she raised her rating on the stock to outperform from long-term outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;She said that, with the exception of Europe, the PC market was strong worldwide.</p>
<p>&quot;Manufacturing is moving smoothly. The Pentium Pro production ramp up is the fastest in the company's history, bringing costs down at a rapid rate.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 4-7/8 at 93-1/2 in midday exchange trading.</p>
</text>
